  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 7.9% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.69B (7.9% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/09/28/ai-agents-could-drain-cheap-bank-deposits-apollo-s-torsten-slok-warns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI agents could drain cheap bank deposits, Apollo&#x27;s Torsten Slok warns</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/ondo-launches-tokenized-portfolios-built-on-blackrock-strategies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo Launches Tokenized Portfolios Built on BlackRock Strategies</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/cefi/bitget-sygnum-protect-off-exchange-custody\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bitget Moves Institutional Collateral To Sygnum&#x27;s Off-Exchange Custody</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/28/redotpay-completes-financial-audit-as-it-presses-ahead-with-u-s-ipo-plans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RedotPay completes financial audit as it presses ahead with U.S. IPO plans</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
